{"availability":"available","full":"arvids-unavailable/openGym","name":"openGym","description":"https://github.com/DuarteSantos8/openGym","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":7208,"forks":1183,"created":"2026-08-03T18:16:58Z","updated":"2026-08-03T19:19:38Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://duartesantos8.github.io/openGym/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:44.494Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:44.494Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:44.494Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:05:44.494Z","stars":7208,"forks":1183}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-hosted gym & body-weight tracker you actually own.","Home — today's workout & weight Guided workout — animated demos & sets Stats — heatmap, charts & PRs","Most workout apps lock your data behind a login on their servers, nag you to upgrade, or disappear when the startup does. openGym is the opposite: it runs on your box, your data stays in a folder you control, and it's yours to fork. It still feels modern — installable as a home-screen app, passkey sign-in, offline support, sync across your phone and laptop."],"features":["⚖️ Body-weight tracking — interactive chart with a goal line you set, gains/losses colored by whether they move toward it","🏋️ Weekly plan — a routine per weekday, over a library of 1,324 exercises (searchable, with animated demos)","🗓️ Reschedule any day — sick, missed a session, or fewer gym days this week? Move a workout to another day without touching your weekly plan","▶️ Guided workouts — it knows what day it is and starts today's session; asks your body weight first, pre-fills your weights from last time, rest timer, PR detection, per-exercise weight tracking","☀️ The screen stays awake while you train — no unlocking the phone and finding your place again between every set. On for as long as a workout is running, released the moment you finish it, and switchable off in Settings"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/arvids-unavailable/openGym/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cb86e6d34ec165bc804a47843ea9aa55b32e72bced79980682398ca77ed96997","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:44.549Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:44.549Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A self-hosted gym & body-weight tracker you actually own.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/arvids-unavailable/openGym/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"A self-hosted gym & body-weight tracker you actually own.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/arvids-unavailable/openGym/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Plan your week, run guided workouts, track every set and your body weight over time — on your phone, synced across devices, behind your own passkey login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/arvids-unavailable/openGym/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No account on someone else's server, no subscription, no ads.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/arvids-unavailable/openGym/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Self-hosting gets you multi-device sync and profiles for friends & family; the mobile app is the install-and-done flavor.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/arvids-unavailable/openGym/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"cb86e6d34ec165bc804a47843ea9aa55b32e72bced79980682398ca77ed96997","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/arvids-unavailable/openGym/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:44.549Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-03T19:19:38Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/arvids-unavailable/openGym/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:13:04.319Z","hash":"cb86e6d34ec165bc804a47843ea9aa55b32e72bced79980682398ca77ed96997","originalBytes":15580,"storedBytes":15580,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["app","set","dat